AMORCE - 3 steps to a self-running box
=======================================

Convention des etapes : [Theme+numero]
  P Prepa | I Install | C Config | O Optim | R Re-check
  N iNspection | S Serveur | W Web IHM | B Boot
Detail complet : docs/STARTUP.md

Prereq on the key root : <latest>.dpk (+ .sha256) and deploy.sh

[I1] INSTALL - from adb shell, as root:
       sh /mnt/media_rw/*/deploy.sh INSTALL
     -> installs from the dpk, copies panel + INSTALLER.sh + docs,
        poses the boot hook, prints the PROCHAINES ETAPES checklist.

Then follow the printed checklist :
  [C1] config CHECK      validate configuration
  [R1] nreg              non-regression (10 themes)
  [S1] manage            global services / web / ports state
  [W0] browser: http://<ip-box>:8000/   (6 pages, green badges)

[B1] REBOOT:
     wait 4-6 min -> panel comes back ALONE.
     Memory profile, network, clock, web stack restart by themselves.
